{"sourceUrl":"https://www.shsmu.edu.cn/sri/info/1076/3383.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:37.711156+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.shsmu.edu.cn/sri/info/1076/3383.htm","html":"<div> <div>\n\n\n<div>\n<p><strong><span><span></span></span></strong><strong><br/></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>为促进全国优秀大学生之间的交流，激发青年学生对神经科学领域研究的兴趣，增进学生对我院学科和导师的了解，上海交通大学医学院松江研究院将于</span></span><span>9<span>月</span></span><span><span>中</span></span><span><span>下</span></span><span><span>旬线下举办</span>2025<span>年推免生选拔工作。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、学院与学科概览</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1<span>、上海交通大学医学院简介</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>上海交通大学医学院位于创新求索、文化荟萃、包容并蓄的上海市黄浦腹地，校园红墙映日，梧桐环绕。其前身是由圣约翰大学医学院（</span>1896-1952<span>）、震旦大学医学院（</span><span>1911-1952</span><span>）、同德医学院（</span><span>1918-1952</span><span>）于</span><span>1952</span><span>年全国高等学校院系调整时合并而成的上海第二医学院，</span><span>1985</span><span>年更名为上海第二医科大学。</span><span>1997</span><span>年学校通过了</span><span>“211</span><span>工程</span><span>”</span><span>立项。</span><span>2005</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月，上海交通大学与上海第二医科大学合并，成立了新的由教育部、上海市政府重点共建的上海交通大学医学院，进入</span><span>“985”</span><span>高校行列。</span><span>2010</span><span>年</span><span>11</span><span>月，学院成为卫生部与教育部合作共建的第一批十个重点高校之一。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2<span>、松江研究院简介</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>上海交通大学医学院松江研究院（以下简称研究院）于</span>2022<span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日正式成立， 是上海市松江区人民政府和上海交通大学医学院合作共建的科研机构。研究院大力推进机制体制创新，立足上海交通大学医学院</span><span>-“</span><span>脑科学研究联盟</span><span>”</span><span>在脑功能和脑疾病等领域的研究优势，以承担国家科技创新</span><span>2030-“</span><span>脑科学与类脑研究</span><span>”</span><span>重大项目和共建上海交通大学医学院附属松江医院（以下简称松江医院）为契机，对接上海交通大学医学院</span><span>“</span><span>双一流</span><span>”</span><span>建设和上海交通大学校本部</span><span>“</span><span>大健康</span><span>”</span><span>战略；不断完善跨学科、跨院系和跨行业的学科交叉体制机制，切实促进医工交叉，以及脑科学与基础医学、临床医学等优势学科的深度融合，构建</span><span>“</span><span>人才链、创新链、产业链</span><span>”</span><span>，助力松江医院高质量发展，提升区域医疗服务的能级和水平，为</span><span>“</span><span>健康松江</span><span>”</span><span>建设提供有力支撑。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>研究院秉持</span><span>“</span><span>人才是第一资源，创新是第一动力</span><span>”</span><span>的理念，聚集一批具有国际视野的高水平人才队伍，现已招募</span><span>23</span><span>位国内外优秀</span><span>PI</span><span>到岗开展研究工作。研究院联动</span><span>G60</span><span>科创走廊生物医药、脑智科创产业群优质资源，主攻</span><span>“</span><span>三脑</span><span>”</span><span>（发育脑、精神脑、退变脑），结合神经免疫、神经代谢和神经肿瘤等新兴脑交叉方向，</span></span><span><span>研究院即将启用</span>3<span>万平方米</span><span>“</span></span><span><span>基础</span>-<span>临床</span><span>-</span><span>产业</span><span>”</span><span>全链条科研平台，致力于催生重大创新性、原创性、颠覆性基础研究成果的产出，实现原始创新关键技术的重大突破，培育一批具有创新思维和国际影响力的脑科学产、学、研专业人才，助力上海生物医药及人工智能产业的高质量发展，支撑</span><span>“</span><span>健康上海</span><span>”</span><span>乃至</span><span>“</span><span>健康中国</span><span>”</span><span>和具有全球影响力的</span><span>G60</span><span>科技创新中心建设，成为中国脑科学研发策源地，以及松江区经济社会发展的新引擎。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>松江研究院入职</span>PI<span>在近</span><span>3</span><span>年在国际顶级期刊发表系列论文，包括</span><span>Science</span><span>，</span><span>Cell , Nature Neuroscience, Cell Stem Cell, Neuron </span><span>等三十余篇。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>网址：</span>https://www.shsmu.edu.cn/sri</span></p>\n<p><span>3<span>、研究生培养方向</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>以神经生物学为核心，依托于</span>23<span>个课题组，涵盖以下领域：神经科学</span></span><span><span>、免疫学、</span></span><span><span>脑疾病研究</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>医工交叉</span></span><span><span>等。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p>\n<span><span>1. </span></span>  \r\n  <span><span>基础医学、生物学、药学、医学技术等生命科学相关专业背景的</span>2026<span>年应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p>\n<p>\n<span><span>2. </span></span>  \r\n  <span><span>英</span></span><span><span>语水平须达到</span>CET6≥425<span>、</span><span>TOEFL≥90</span><span>或</span><span>IELTS≥6.0</span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p>\n<span><span>3. </span></span>  \r\n  <span><span>政治思想品德良好，身心健康；</span></span></p>\n<p>\n<span><span>4. </span></span>  \r\n  <span><span>学风端正，学习成绩优异，有志于神经科学研究，具备一定的科研能力与科研潜力。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、推免选拔日程安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>时间：</span></span><span><span>暂定</span></span><span>202</span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span><span>19</span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地点：上海市松江区中山中路</span>748<span>号（上海交通大学医学院附属松江医院）</span><span>18</span><span>号楼一楼会议室</span></span></p>\n<p><span>9<span>月</span></span><span>18</span><span><span>日下午</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>点：推免生报到，提交材料和</span>PPT</span></p>\n<p><span>9<span>月</span></span><span>19</span><span><span>日上午</span>9<span>点</span><span>-11</span><span>点：笔试</span></span></p>\n<p><span>9<span>月</span></span><span>19 </span><span><span>日下午</span>1<span>点开始面试</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、报名方式及材料准备</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. <span>登录网上报名系统（</span><span>https://yjs.shsmu.edu.cn/</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>，我院的学院代码为：</span></span><span>735</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. <span>网上报名时间为</span><span>202</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>日</span>-</span><span>16</span><span><span>日内。</span></span><span><span>请填写报名表并按要求上传相关材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3. <span>松江研究院将根据学生的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力等情况进行筛选，</span></span><span><span>预计</span></span><span><span>于</span>9<span>月</span></span><span>17</span><span><span>日左右确定复试名单，并发出复试通知，请注意查收邮箱和电话。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试时须向复试小组提供以下材料：</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1. <span>《上海交通大学医学院推荐免试申请表》</span><span>1</span><span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.  <span>学生证复印件</span><span>1</span><span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.  <span>身份证复印件</span><span>1</span><span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.  <span>本科成绩单</span><span>1</span><span>份（加盖所在学校教务处公章，装入自备信封密封后须在封口处骑缝加盖教务处公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>5.  <span>英语水平证明</span><span>1</span><span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>6.  <span>两封专家推荐信（仅直博生）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>7. <span>个人简历</span><span>10</span><span>份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>8.  PPT<span>电子版，</span><span>1</span><span>份（限时</span><span>10</span><span>分钟）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人还可提交获奖证书、公开发表的学术论文等复印件</span></span><em></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>注：身份证和学生证须准备原件用于核验；所有材料的电子版</span>/<span>扫描件请按要求上传报名系统；入围</span></span></em><em><span><span>者</span></span></em><em><span><span>请准备全套纸质版材料，</span></span></em><em><span><span>报到时</span></span></em><em><span><span>提交给</span></span></em><em><span><span>相关老师</span></span></em><em><span><span>。</span></span></em><em></em></p>\n<h3><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></strong></h3>\n<p><strong><span><span>咨询电话</span></span></strong><span><span>：</span></span><span>021-67722300</span><span><span>（石老师）</span></span><span><br/></span><strong><span><span>电子邮箱</span></span></strong><span><span>：</span></span><a href=\"https://mailto:yufeng.shi@shsmu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>yufeng.shi@shsmu.edu.cn</span></a><span><br/></span><strong><span><span>研究院官网</span></span></strong><span><span>：</span></span><a href=\"https://www.shsmu.edu.cn/sri\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://www.shsmu.edu.cn/sri</span></a></p>\n</div>\n\n</div></div>","textSha256":"1ae464952134351a370729e9571e974bf684561c67dda518899de5809a9e606e","textLength":2027,"sourceSha256":"64f7bb3431cec2017bea3e7452b237e5008f6116fdb937bdef266d1e54474024","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5c5492263f7797ac513f","title":"2025年上海交通大学医学院松江研究院2025年推免生选拔工作方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:37.711156+00:00"}
